TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk1=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk I, a powerful energy weapon utilizing controlled singularities for immense destructive capability and large-scale power generation. This advanced cannon is key to achieving energy dominance and technological superiority in space.
