TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk3=Develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk III, a high-output energy weapon utilizing cutting-edge singularity control for superior power and efficiency in large-scale space operations. This advanced cannon provides a significant advantage in energy dominance and technological advancement.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk4=Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk4=Develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk IV, a powerful energy weapon utilizing advanced singularity control for superior output and efficiency in large-scale space operations. This upgrade to the Mk III delivers increased power and stability, crucial for achieving energy dominance.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk5=Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk V
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk5=Develop the Prototype Plasma Cannon Mk V, a cutting-edge energy weapon utilizing singularity technology for unmatched power and efficiency in space operations. This advanced cannon offers significant advantages in energy output, stability, and overall technological dominance.
