TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaCannon_Mk6=Research and develop the Mk VI Plasma Cannon, a powerful energy weapon utilizing cutting-edge singularity technology for unmatched output and efficiency in space operations. This advanced cannon is crucial for establishing energy dominance and powering future technological advancements.

