TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Subjugation_Protocols=Streamlines planetary governance by adapting Elite Marine tactics to swiftly integrate and pacify conquered worlds.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Orebloom=Orebloom
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Orebloom=Increase mining yields with Orebloom, a biotechnology that uses orbital infrastructure to bio-augment ore density.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Symbiotic_Shield=Symbiotic Shield
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Symbiotic_Shield=A biocomputing system that creates a reactive shield by bonding with local pherocyte colonies, defending against biological threats.
