TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Strategic_Foresight=Strategic Foresight
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Strategic_Foresight=Building upon established space militarization protocols, Strategic Foresight enhances knowledge priority analysis. This yields a 5% increase in research efficiency for critical technologies.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Pherocyte_Resilience=Pherocyte Resilience
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Pherocyte_Resilience=Following established international protocols, this project enhances colony resilience to Pherocyte-based social disruption via targeted neurological conditioning, mitigating manipulative influence and panic responses.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Habitability_Focus=Habitability Focus
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Habitability_Focus=Refines environmental analysis protocols, building on electromagnetic propulsion systems, to prioritize planetary habitability assessments. Increases the effectiveness of EnvironmentPriority scans by 5%.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Warfront_Logistics=Warfront Logistics
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Warfront_Logistics=Optimized logistical protocols, building upon phased-array laser targeting data, prioritize military resource allocation during fleet engagements, significantly boosting frontline effectiveness.
